<mxCell id="n18" value="FINDING A1 (High). There is no agyari-creation endpoint or UI anywhere. request-otp requires an existing agyary_id; search only returns already-registered agyaries. Doc 06 lists an &#x27;agyari creation fallback if search comes up empty&#x27; — it was never built. A mobed whose agyari isn&#x27;t pre-seeded is stuck. Only seed_demo.py creates an Agyary." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;size=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="590" width="300" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
